                <pb facs="0127" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg77"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                        1894</hi></date>. (Received Sept. 24.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs officially informs me that it is the intention of
                    the President to terminate reciprocity treaty on January 1 proximo.</p>
            </div>
